This repository is public so that partners can download and verify the
software. Being able to read or download it does not grant you a licence.

1. Who may use it

   You may use this software only if you are a hosting company with an active
   partnership agreement with QuantumByte (a "Partner"). If you are not a
   Partner, you have no rights to use, copy, modify or distribute it.

2. What a Partner may do

   While the partnership agreement is in force, a Partner may:

   a. install and run the software on WHMCS installations the Partner
      operates, to sell and manage QuantumByte services for the Partner's own
      customers;
   b. make copies needed for that purpose, including backups, staging and
      test installations;
   c. modify the software for that purpose; and
   d. let its employees and contractors do the above on the Partner's behalf.

3. What a Partner may not do

   a. Distribute, sell, sublicense or publish the software or modified
      versions of it, except as part of operating its own WHMCS as allowed
      above.
   b. Use the software, or any part of it, to connect WHMCS to any service
      other than QuantumByte.
   c. Remove or change this licence or any copyright notice.
   d. Use the software to get around the limits, pricing or terms of the
      partnership agreement.

4. Customers' apps

   Ending this licence does not stop apps that a Partner's customers have
   already published from running on infrastructure the Partner controls.
   It ends the Partner's right to keep using this software.

5. End of the licence

   This licence ends automatically when the partnership agreement ends, or
   when the Partner breaches it and does not fix the breach within 30 days
   of written notice. When it ends, the Partner must stop using the software
   and remove it from its WHMCS installations within 30 days.

6. Ownership

   QuantumByte keeps all rights, title and interest in the software. Any
   suggestions a Partner sends may be used by QuantumByte without any
   obligation to the Partner.

7. No warranty

   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
